 > **I. J. Good**, *Speculations Concerning the First Ultraintelligent Machine*, Advances in Computers Vol. 6, 1965 · `papers/classics/1965_Good_UltraintelligentMachine.pdf`（扫描影印版）
 > **E. Yudkowsky**, *General Intelligence and Seed AI 2.3*, Singularity Institute, 2000–2001 · `papers/classics/2001_Yudkowsky_GISAI.pdf` + 中译 · [Web Archive 原版](https://web.archive.org/web/20120805130100/singularity.org/files/GISAI.html)
